<section class="section section--tight customer-story-section" data-render-deferred="true" id="club-colors-story">
<div class="page-shell customer-story" data-reveal="">
<div class="customer-story__main">
<div class="customer-story__header">
<p class="eyebrow">Customer story · Club Colors</p>
<h2>More than developers.<br/>Trusted partners.</h2>
<p>
              For several years, Swishtag has worked alongside Club Colors to build, improve,
              and support enterprise level commerce workflows that help power a complex promotional
              commerce operation.
            </p>
</div>
<blockquote class="customer-story__quote">
<p>
              “We’ve worked with Swishtag for several years, and they’ve become a key part of our team.
              They’ve helped us build enterprise level commerce workflows that support our business,
              and their work has been consistently reliable and high quality.
            </p>
<p>
              What stands out most is that they don’t just execute. They think critically, offer helpful
              suggestions, and speak up when something could be improved. Their development team and
              support staff both play an important role in keeping everything running smoothly.
            </p>
<p>
              At this point, we truly see Swishtag as an extension of our own team, and their
              contributions have been invaluable.”
            </p>
</blockquote>
